How about a stomach of holding?  You can stuff as many corpses in it as you
want, and it never overflows!  

No, seriously, people.  One thing that you have to be very careful to look 
at when you're plotting new and interesting items to add is how they will 
fit into the game as it currently exists.  All in all, the creators and 
developers of nethack have done an excellent job of making a game that holds 
together really well.  No single item, room, or task is so powerful as to 
change the nature of the game.  On the other hand, nethack doesn't have tons 
of useless baggage items lying around, either.

DISCLAIMER - the above didn't apply specifically to the two items suggested,
but to suggestions about additions in general.

